sh illustrations. I would like to send a request to Mr. Jewel the Scribe Bird.\n\nThe contents of the request\nI would like you to design a costume for Willian of my work Alternative Alliance Alpha (AL2α).\n\nUsage\nDisplay on my SNS account and website\nReference design for my games and illustrations\nUse in my own games.\n\nSupplemental information on usage\nAlthough the game is currently a free game, there is a possibility that it will be charged for in the future, and since I have already released another commercial work, it will be used for commercial purposes as well.\nWhen referring to the original design, we may omit or change the design depending on the pattern or seasonal events.\nWe will not use the illustration itself for the production of goods, but we may use the illustration drawn in reference to the design we receive to produce goods.\n\n◆Details of the character\nHeight: about 180cm, body: slender\nThe skin is visible in the part of the body that imitates a crow (bird) (inside is human and wears a full body suit).\nHis personality is calm and his tension is always low. He is always calm and low tension. He is good at taking care of people. Eats well.\n\nRequests\nShoes and coat suitable for long term outdoor activities in rough desert (low temperature and humidity, not below zero).\nNo head protection needed, as the crow's head is a substitute for a helmet.\nFuturistic design (technology can reduce the weight and size of elements that would be heavy equipment today).\nThe colors are mainly achromatic and cold colors.\nLarge backpacks on the back (for carrying goods and souvenirs)\n\n◆Documents\nWillian's current design\nhttps://dear-done-dead.games/materials/al2alpha_willian.png\nMain body of the game\nhttps://unityroom.com/games/al2alpha\n\nPlease cancel if there are any problems. Thank you for your consideration.", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "similar_creators": []}, "price_history": {